    - Id: engine_test
      Title: Engine test / not a launch
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName: 
        Text: Sorry. I just tested the engine. I wasn't expecting it to be so powerful. I hope I didn't startle you. I've also adjusted the ship's attitude for flight. Once repairs are complete, you can start it up.
